Cisco announced AI Defense as one control layer for building AI and for using it. Development controls cover discovery of who is building which app, model validation, and runtime protection. Use controls cover shadow and approved AI, access limits, and ongoing protection of data. Splunk customers receive enriched alerts. A PM uses this record to freeze the vocabulary and the boundary of the product, then attaches a sector scenario when regulation or segmentation is in scope.

Problem: Cisco''s cited 2024 AI Readiness Index said only 29 percent of responding organizations were ready to detect and prevent unauthorized AI manipulation. AI apps span multiple models and clouds. Weaknesses sit in both the model and the application, and the owner may be a developer, a user, or a vendor. Point guardrails inside each model do not give one control.', 593, '[-0.083992,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041996,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041996,0.000000,0.083992,0.000000,0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.083992,-0.251976,0.000000,0.000000,0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041996,0.000000,-0.083992,0.000000,-0.461957,0.000000,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041996,-0.083992,0.000000,0.000000,0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.167984,0.041996,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.083992,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.125988,0.000000,0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.083992,0.000000,-0.251976,0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,-0.083992,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041996,-0.125988,0.041996,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.041996,0.000000,0.083992,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.083992,0.461957,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.125988,-0.041996,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041996,0.