Opportunity: The announcement describes network visibility as the common control layer, so development pipelines and employee use do not each depend on a separately bought point product. Cisco said enterprises could use the product from March 2025.

Strategic alignment: Separate the source card from the sector charter. This record fixes terms. A financial-services or data-center program cites it and does not copy it as that program''s result.

Business value: The organization leaves with two lists, user AI and developer AI, a detection log from the test scenarios, and a written decision on whether to expand. No savings figure is published.', 491, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.111979,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,-0.055989,0.055989,0.000000,0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.111979,-0.391925,0.000000,0.000000,0.055989,0.000000,0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,-0.279946,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,-0.111979,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055989,0.000000,0.111979,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.167968,0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.111979,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.055989,-0.055989,0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.111979,0.000000,-0.279946,0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.111979,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055989,-0.055989,0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,-0.055989,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.391925,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.111979,0.000000,0.000000,0.055989,0.000000,0.055989,-0.111979,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.111979,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.0