In the San Jose announcement Cisco described AI Defense as protection for an enterprise''s AI transformation. For development and deployment it named three controls: discovery of who is building apps and from which training sources, model validation for harmful or unexpected behavior introduced in tuning, and runtime security for prompt injection, denial of service, and sensitive-data exposure.

For use it named three more: visibility of shadow and approved AI, limits on unapproved tools, and ongoing protection against threats and data loss. The announcement says the same controls apply across models, unlike a guardrail inside one model. Detection uses Talos, the product sits in Security Cloud, and enforcement uses the network. Splunk customers get enriched alerts.', 555, '[-0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.087287,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043644,0.000000,0.087287,0.000000,0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.087287,-0.218218,0.000000,0.000000,0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043644,0.087287,-0.480079,0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.130931,0.000000,-0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043644,0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.087287,0.000000,-0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043644,0.000000,-0.043644,0.000000,-0.043644,0.043644,-0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.087287,0.000000,0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.130931,0.000000,-0.218218,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043644,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.261861,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.087287,-0.043644,0.087287,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.130931,0.349149,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.087287,-0.043644,0.000000,-0.043644,0.000000,-0.043