In scope
- A list of user-facing AI and a separate list of AI being built
- A written test set and the detection record
- A decision on whether Splunk enrichment is in scope
- A source note whenever the 29 percent figure is used

Out of scope
- Treating the partner comment as a deployment result
- A data-center segmentation design, which belongs in the Hypershield financial scenario
- Combining the developer approver and the employee-access approver into one person

