1 Source charter [Initiating/Scope] owner Customer PM, 3–5 days, deliverable: Charter. Name this record as a source card. Name the sector scenario if one exists.
2.1 Two lists [Planning/Scope] owner Security architect, 5–10 days, deliverable: Lists. Inventory user AI and developer AI separately.
2.2 Subscription check [Planning/Procurement] owner Customer PM, 5–10 days, deliverable: Procurement note. Record the March 2025 availability terms and the pilot SKU.
2.3 Test set [Planning/Security] owner Security architect, 5–8 days, deliverable: Test set. Write scenarios for discovery, validation, and runtime.
3.1 Run the tests [Executing/Quality] owner Security architect, 10–15 days, deliverable: Detection record. Keep the detection record. Do not add a savings claim.
3.2 Alert path [Executing/Integration] owner Detection lead, 3–8 days, deliverable: Alert note. Turn on Splunk enrichment only if Splunk is in the environment.
4 Readout [Monitoring and controlling/Communications] owner Customer PM, 2–4 days, deliverable: Readout. Show the lists and the record. Footnote the 29 percent if it appears.
