Outcomes
- Published fact, 15 January 2025: Cisco described discovery of shadow and approved AI, model validation, runtime protection, access control, and data protection as one solution.
- Published fact: Cisco said it participates in related MITRE, OWASP, and NIST work.
- Published fact: Splunk customers receive enriched alerts. That sentence does not apply to a customer without Splunk.

