Opportunity: Cisco''s public Hypershield design describes enforcement close to the workload and upgrades that qualify themselves on a dual data plane. AI Defense adds discovery of shadow and approved AI, model validation, and runtime controls. Together they give a sequence: discover, observe, then decide whether to enforce.

Strategic alignment: The control objective is visibility and a reversible policy, aligned to electronic-financial supervision, privacy, and credit-information duties. Speed of mitigation is not the acceptance test.

Business value: The sponsor can point at an inventory, an observation report, and a written enforce-or-hold decision. The program does not claim a percentage reduction in MTTR.', 577, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.099627,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,-0.249068,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.149441,0.049814,-0.398508,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.199254,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,-0.049814,0.000000,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.049814,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.099627,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.149441,-0.099627,0.000000,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.049814,-0.398508,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.099627,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.298881,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049814,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049814,0.000000,0.000000