On 18 April 2024 Cisco described Hypershield as distributed security for the AI-scale data center, with enforcement close to workloads and upgrades that can be qualified on a dual data plane before they carry traffic. On 15 January 2025 Cisco described AI Defense as discovery, model validation, runtime protection, and access control for enterprise AI.

This scenario places those two public designs in one financial-services pilot. The regulation set is the Korean electronic-financial supervision rule, the Personal Information Protection Act, and the Credit Information Act, plus NIST AI RMF and the OWASP LLM Top 10 as the control references. Nothing in the public posts is a bank''s measured result, so this record does not add one.', 586, '[-0.045222,0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.180886,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.045222,-0.361773,0.045222,0.000000,0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.090443,0.135665,-0.271329,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.045222,-0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.180886,0.000000,0.000000,0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,-0.090443,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.135665,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.090443,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.045222,0.000000,0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.045222,0.045222,-0.406994,0.090443,0.000000,0.000000,-0.090443,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.045222,-0.090443,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.135665,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.090443,0.271329,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.045222,-0.045222,0.045222,-0.045222,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.0