In scope
- One business line and the AI applications that touch its data
- An inventory of approved and unapproved AI applications
- Shadow-mode observation with a rollback
- A written decision before enforce mode

Out of scope
- Naming a bank that has not been named in the input
- An MTTR percentage
- Enforce mode during the observation window
- A full data-center fabric replacement

Assumptions
- The CISO will not delegate the enforce decision. (owner: CISO (sponsor), status: open)
- The business line can name the applications and the data classes. (owner: Business owner, status: open)

Constraints
- [regulatory] Customer and credit data stay in the classified stores. A new AI application does not become a second copy.
- [technical] Shadow mode is the only mode until the observation report is accepted.', 625, '[0.000000,0.000000,-0.127573,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042524,0.000000,0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.127573,-0.212622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042524,-0.467768,0.000000,0.000000,0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.170097,-0.297670,0.127573,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.212622,0.000000,0.000000,0.042524,-0.042524,0.000000,-0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.127573,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042524,-0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.085049,-0.085049,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.127573,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042524,0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042524,0.000000,-0.212622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.085049,0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042524,0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.127573,0.297670,-0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042524,-0.085049,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.085049,0.042524,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042524,0.000000,0.085049,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042524,0