1 Boundary [Initiating/Scope] owner Customer PM, 5–8 days, deliverable: Charter. Name the business line. State that this is a planning scenario, not a published bank result.
2.1 Regulatory note [Planning/AI governance] owner Operational risk, 8–12 days, deliverable: Note. Map the data classes to the supervision, privacy, and credit-information duties.
2.2 Inventory [Planning/Security] owner Security architect, 10–15 days, deliverable: Inventory. List approved and unapproved AI applications for the business line.
2.3 Shadow design [Planning/Quality] owner Security architect, 8–12 days, deliverable: Runbook. Write the policy and the rollback. Enforce stays off.
3.1 Observation window [Executing/Security] owner Security architect, 15–25 days, deliverable: Observation log. Run shadow mode. Record what would have been blocked.
3.2 Rollback rehearsal [Executing/Quality] owner Data-center operations, 3–5 days, deliverable: Rehearsal note. Rehearse the rollback in the agreed change window.
4 Observation report [Monitoring and controlling/Communications] owner Customer PM, 5–8 days, deliverable: Report. Show would-block events beside the inventory. Do not print an MTTR percentage.
5 Enforce or hold [Closing/Risk] owner CISO (sponsor), 3–5 days, deliverable: Decision. The CISO writes enforce or hold. The default is hold.', 884, '[0.000000,0.000000,-0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.268311,0.000000,0.000000,0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.100617,-0.067078,0.000000,-0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033539,-0.368928,0.000000,0.000000,0.033539,-0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.033539,-0.167695,0.067078,-0.268311,0.033539,0.000000,0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.067078,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.067078,-0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.134156,0.000000,0.000000,0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033539,0.067078,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033539,0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.368928,0.000000,-0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.033539,-0.033539,0.000000,-0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.067078,-0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.067078,-0.134156,0.067078,0.000000,0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033539,0.033539,0.000000,0.033539,-0.033539,0.033539,-0.167695,0.067078,0.000000,0.000000,-0.067078,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.067078,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.067078,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033539,0.201234,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.100617,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033539,-0.033539,0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033539,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0