Outcomes
- Planning outcome: an inventory and a shadow-mode report for one business line. This is not a published customer result.
- Published design goal: Hypershield describes mitigation in minutes and self-qualifying upgrades on a dual data plane. That is Cisco''s product design, not a measured bank outcome.
- Published fact: AI Defense, announced 15 January 2025, covers discovery, validation, runtime protection, and access control.

KPIs
- Inventory coverage: baseline Unknown AI applications → target Every in-scope application marked approved or unapproved percent. Inventory review with the business owner
- Enforce actions during observation: baseline Not allowed → target Zero count. Change log
- Unlabeled design goals: baseline Unset → target Zero unlabeled uses of minutes-to-mitigate count. Report review', 628, '[0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,-0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,-0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.103280,-0.258199,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,-0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.206559,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,-0.154919,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,0.000000,0.206559,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.103280,-0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.000000,-0.309839,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.103280,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.309839,0.000000,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051640,-0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.051640,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051640,0.154919,-0.051640,0.000000,-0.206559,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000