Cost planning band
The 750,000 to 2,500,000 US dollar range and the week ranges are planning bands for a first financial pilot. They are not a quote and not a bank''s spend.
- AI Defense and Hypershield pilot (opex): 400000–1500000 USD. Planning band. Do not add a second order that duplicates CSCO-AID-ENT-001 without a portfolio check.
- Observation and rollback design (opex): 150000–500000 USD. Planning band.
- Splunk investigation store (opex): 0–300000 USD. Only if Splunk is not already entitled.

Decisions
- D1 Mode: Shadow until the CISO writes otherwise.. The public design allows observation on a second data plane. The scenario uses that, and does not invent a zero-downtime result.
- D2 Customer names: No bank is named unless the person requesting the draft named it.. This record is a composite, not a reference customer.', 636, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.128271,0.000000,0.085514,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.085514,0.000000,-0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,-0.299298,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.213785,0.042757,-0.384812,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042757,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.085514,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.213785,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,0.000000,0.042757,-0.042757,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.085514,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042757,0.171028,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.085514,0.000000,0.085514,-0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,-0.042757,0.000000,-0.299298,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.085514,0.000000,-0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.213785,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.085514,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042757,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.085514,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042757,0.128271,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.0000