title: Enterprise AI factory pilot on the Cisco and NVIDIA reference architecture
industry: Technology and infrastructure (technology)
segment: Enterprise and neocloud
solutions: Cisco UCS, Nexus Hyperfabric AI, Cisco Silicon One, Cisco AI Defense, Cisco Hypershield
partners: NVIDIA AI Enterprise, NVIDIA Spectrum-X, Certified storage partner
aliases: Secure AI Factory, NVIDIA, GPU pod, Spectrum-X, Hyperfabric
fidelity: primary_source
Cisco and NVIDIA published a Secure AI Factory pattern that ties UCS AI, Hyperfabric AI, Silicon One, Spectrum-X, certified storage, and NVIDIA AI Enterprise. Later public notes place AI Defense and Hypershield in the validated design. A PM uses the publications to freeze one pod: GPU count, rack, storage partner, and NOS. The first success is one fine-tune or one inference job, plus a security observation report. A full factory is out of scope.

Problem: Training and inference split across a front-end network, a back-end network, GPU-to-GPU traffic, storage, and security. Buying those separately produces two operating models. Some organizations cannot put the data in a public cloud. A prototype then has no path to production.', 599, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.164122,-0.082061,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.082061,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,-0.205152,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041030,0.000000,-0.123091,0.041030,-0.451335,0.000000,-0.041030,0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,0.000000,0.082061,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.082061,0.000000,0.000000,-0.082061,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,-0.164122,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,-0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,-0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,-0.164122,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.082061,0.000000,0.000000,0.205152,-0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,-0.041030,0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,-0.328244,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.082061,0.000000,0.000000,0.123091,0.000000,0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041030,0.000000,-0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.082061,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041030,0.041030,-0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.082061,0.410305,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.082061,-0.082061,0.000000,-0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041030,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000