aliases: Secure AI Factory, NVIDIA, GPU pod, Spectrum-X, Hyperfabric
fidelity: primary_source
Opportunity: The February 2025 partnership note says Silicon One is the only partner silicon planned for Spectrum-X Ethernet. The March 2025 Secure AI Factory announcement bundles the compute, fabric, storage, and software. The June 2025 note includes AI Defense and Hypershield in the NVIDIA Enterprise AI Factory validated design.

Strategic alignment: Size the pod to one validation job. Power, export control, and a security observation mode come before the purchase order.

Business value: The sponsor has a signed scale card and one finished job on that pod. Roadmap features that cannot be ordered today are not success criteria.', 549, '[-0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.172133,-0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.086066,0.000000,0.000000,0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043033,-0.430331,0.000000,0.000000,0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043033,0.000000,-0.430331,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.086066,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.086066,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.215166,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043033,-0.086066,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043033,0.000000,0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043033,-0.086066,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.086066,0.000000,0.000000,0.172133,0.000000,0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043033,0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,-0.215166,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.129099,0.000000,0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043033,0.000000,-0.086066,0.000000,0.000000,0.043033,0.000000,0.086066,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043033,0.000000,-0.129099,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043033,0.344265,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043033,0.000000,-0.086066,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.086066,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.086066,-0.086066,0.000000,-0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043033,0.000000,0.000000,0