title: Enterprise AI factory pilot on the Cisco and NVIDIA reference architecture
industry: Technology and infrastructure (technology)
segment: Enterprise and neocloud
solutions: Cisco UCS, Nexus Hyperfabric AI, Cisco Silicon One, Cisco AI Defense, Cisco Hypershield
partners: NVIDIA AI Enterprise, NVIDIA Spectrum-X, Certified storage partner
aliases: Secure AI Factory, NVIDIA, GPU pod, Spectrum-X, Hyperfabric
fidelity: primary_source
In scope
- A scale card with GPU count, racks, one storage partner, and NOS
- One operating model for front-end and back-end networks
- Security controls in observation mode
- One validation job, either fine-tune or inference

Out of scope
- A hundreds-of-thousands-GPU neocloud
- A roadmap feature that cannot be ordered today, used as a success criterion
- Full pretraining of a foundation model on customer data

Assumptions
- Legal reviews GPU export and procurement constraints at the start. (owner: Legal, status: open)
- Facilities can say whether the rack design fits the hall. (owner: Data-center facilities, status: open)

Constraints
- [regulatory] If training-data residency contradicts the pod location, the job does not load.
- [procurement] No purchase order before the facilities gate and the scale card.', 641, '[-0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,-0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.095023,0.000000,0.142534,-0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.095023,0.000000,-0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,-0.380091,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,-0.380091,0.000000,-0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,-0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.190046,0.000000,0.000000,0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,-0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.095023,0.000000,-0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,-0.047511,0.000000,-0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.095023,-0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.190046,0.000000,0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.237557,0.000000,-0.047511,0.000000,-0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.095023,0.000000,0.047511,-0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,-0.047511,0.000000,-0.095023,0.000000,-0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.142534,0.000000,0.047511,-0.047511,0.000000,-0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.095023,0.237557,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047511,0.000000,-0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.095023,0.000000,-0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047511,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.095023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.04