1 Scale card [Initiating/Scope] owner Infrastructure PM, 10–15 days, deliverable: Scale card. Cap the GPUs and name the one validation job.
2.1 Export review [Planning/Procurement] owner Legal, 10–20 days, deliverable: Legal note. Legal checks whether the GPU count can be ordered.
2.2 Facilities gate [Planning/Resource] owner Data-center facilities, 10–15 days, deliverable: Capacity note. Compare the rack design with hall power and cooling.
2.3 Orderable versus roadmap [Planning/Integration] owner Network architect, 5–10 days, deliverable: Comparison. Split what can be purchased now from published direction.
3.1 Purchase order [Executing/Procurement] owner Infrastructure PM, 15–30 days, deliverable: Orders. Order GPUs, switches, and storage against the scale card.
3.2 Validation job [Executing/Quality] owner AI platform, 15–25 days, deliverable: Job record. Finish one fine-tune or one inference job on the pod.
4 Observation [Monitoring and controlling/Security] owner Security architect, 10–15 days, deliverable: Observation report. Security watches the pod and keeps a rollback.
5 Keep or shrink [Closing/Scope] owner Infrastructure sponsor, 5–8 days, deliverable: Decision. The sponsor accepts the pod or cuts the card. A full factory is a new charter.', 865, '[-0.097797,0.000000,0.000000,0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.032599,-0.260793,0.000000,0.000000,0.130396,-0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.065198,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.065198,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.032599,-0.358590,0.032599,0.000000,0.032599,-0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.097797,0.000000,-0.325991,0.000000,0.000000,0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.032599,0.065198,0.000000,0.000000,-0.032599,0.097797,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,-0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.130396,0.000000,0.000000,0.065198,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.032599,-0.065198,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.325991,0.000000,-0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.032599,0.000000,0.032599,0.000000,0.130396,0.000000,0.000000,-0.065198,0.000000,0.000000,0.065198,0.000000,0.065198,-0.097797,0.000000,0.000000,0.130396,0.000000,0.097797,-0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.032599,-0.032599,0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.162995,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.097797,0.000000,0.000000,0.065198,0.000000,0.032599,-0.097797,0.000000,-0.032599,0.000000,-0.130396,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.065198,-0.032599,0.000000,-0.032599,0.000000,-0.032599,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.195594,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.032599,-0.03