R2 Not enough power [resource] P3 I5 avoid. Mitigation: No order before the facilities gate. Trigger: The capacity note fails Owner: Data-center facilities
R3 Two network operating models [integration] P3 I4 mitigate. Mitigation: One NOS decision on the scale card. Trigger: Two runbooks appear Owner: Network architect
