Outcomes
- Published fact, February 2025: Silicon One is described as the only partner silicon planned for Spectrum-X Ethernet.
- Published fact, March 2025: Secure AI Factory bundles UCS AI, Hyperfabric AI, Silicon One, Spectrum-X, certified storage, and NVIDIA AI Enterprise.
- Published fact, June 2025: AI Defense and Hypershield are included in the NVIDIA Enterprise AI Factory validated design.

KPIs
- Scale-card changes after the order: baseline None → target Only through the decision log count. Change control
- Validation job: baseline Not started → target One job finished on the ordered pod count. Job record
