Cost planning band
Price moves with GPU count. The band below is a small enterprise pilot pod, not a quote.
- Compute, fabric, and storage pilot (capex): 1800000–13000000 USD. Planning band dominated by GPU count.
- NVIDIA AI Enterprise and NOS (opex): 150000–900000 USD. Planning band.
- AI Defense and Hypershield start (opex): 200000–900000 USD. Check the portfolio so this is not a second order of the financial pilot.

Decisions
- D1 First pod size: Cut to the cap that can run one validation job, not to enterprise demand.. The XL band is sensitive to GPU count. Without a cap the schedule disappears.
- D2 What is not a success test: Published direction that cannot be ordered is a later charter.. Acceptance has to be possible on the bill of materials.', 611, '[-0.082409,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.123613,0.000000,0.082409,-0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,-0.082409,0.041204,0.000000,0.082409,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041204,-0.329634,0.000000,0.000000,0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.288430,0.000000,-0.288430,0.000000,0.000000,0.041204,0.000000,0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.082409,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041204,0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041204,-0.288430,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.041204,-0.082409,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.082409,0.000000,0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.082409,0.000000,0.041204,-0.123613,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,-0.123613,0.000000,0.000000,0.082409,0.000000,0.041204,-0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.206021,0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.082409,0.000000,0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041204,0.164817,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.288430,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,-0.082409,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041204,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.082409,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041204,0.000000,0.