Cisco Live sessions on cognitive collaboration and responsible AI, and the Webex transparency notes, separate features. Noise removal is described as on-device processing. Virtual backgrounds are described as trained across lighting conditions and demographic groups, after early models performed differently by hairstyle, skin tone, and lighting. Noise removal had a similar gap in higher vocal registers, which Cisco says later data and tests addressed. Gesture recognition is described as a model built from consented internal data, and Cisco''s response on AI-enabled biometrics treats that class of feature as sensitive.', 472, '[-0.060634,0.121268,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.121268,0.000000,0.242536,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.121268,0.060634,-0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.060634,-0.121268,0.000000,0.000000,0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.060634,0.121268,-0.424437,0.000000,0.000000,0.060634,-0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.060634,-0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.060634,0.000000,-0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.121268,0.000000,0.000000,-0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.121268,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.060634,0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.181902,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.303170,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.121268,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.060634,-0.303170,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.060634,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000