Outcomes
- Public description: Cisco Live material says noise-removal processing happens on the device, so that feature does not send the audio to the cloud.
- Public description: early virtual backgrounds varied by hairstyle, skin tone, and lighting, and noise removal varied in the higher register. Cisco says later data and tests closed the gaps.
- Public description: Webex does not by default train models on customer content. It uses licensed, internal, and synthetic data, and runs an AI impact assessment per feature.

KPIs
- Rows with a data flow: baseline One generic policy → target Every feature percent. Table review
- Automatic actions from the LLM: baseline Not allowed → target Zero count. Automation review
- Features enabled with no row: baseline Unknown → target Zero count. Admin settings', 564, '[-0.048622,0.097243,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.097243,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.048622,0.000000,-0.145865,0.000000,0.000000,0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.048622,-0.388973,0.000000,-0.048622,0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.048622,0.145865,-0.291730,0.000000,0.000000,0.048622,-0.097243,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.048622,0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.048622,0.000000,-0.048622,0.000000,-0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.048622,0.000000,-0.048622,0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,-0.145865,0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.097243,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.048622,0.000000,0.097243,0.000000,0.000000,-0.048622,0.000000,-0.048622,0.097243,0.000000,0.194487,0.000000,0.000000,-0.243108,0.000000,0.000000,0.048622,-0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.048622,-0.340352,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.048622,0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.048622,0.000000,0.048622,-0.048622,0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.048622,-0.048622,0.145865,0.000000,0.000000,-0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.097243,0.000000,-0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.097243,0.000000,0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.194487,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.048622,0.000000,-0.194487,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.048622,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.