title: Governance plan for Webex specialized models and security-product LLM use
industry: Collaboration (workplace)
segment: Enterprise
solutions: Webex, Webex AI, Cisco AI security proxy
partners: 
aliases: Webex, noise removal, virtual background, gesture, LLM, bias
fidelity: public_composite
Cost planning band
Amounts and durations are planning bands for a collaboration program. They are not a list price.
- Webex AI entitlements for the pilot group (opex): 40000–250000 USD. Planning band.
- Privacy review and tests (opex): 30000–150000 USD. Internal privacy time can replace part of this.
- Security evaluation set (opex): 20000–80000 USD. Analyst time. Not a model-training budget.

Decisions
- D1 Training default: Customer content is not used to train the model.. That is the public Webex position. The pilot repeats it.
- D2 What the security LLM is: A prompt, a review, and a human approval. Not foundation-model training and not an automatic action.. The public XDR material describes draft summaries. It does not publish a training recipe.', 539, '[-0.051571,0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.206284,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051571,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.051571,-0.309426,0.000000,0.000000,0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.206284,0.000000,-0.257855,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.103142,0.051571,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.103142,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.103142,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051571,-0.103142,0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.309426,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.206284,0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.154713,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.051571,0.000000,0.154713,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.051571,0.000000,0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.051571,0.000000,0.000000,0.154713,0.000000,0.0000