In scope
- Fabric design for one hall or one pod
- A split between spans that need 400G and spans that reuse fiber
- The operations-dashboard scope
- A dual-plane rehearsal for a security policy change
- A 6 to 10 week pilot start after hardware arrives

Out of scope
- Campus and overseas sites
- A success criterion that the whole data center finishes in a few weeks
- Training the model itself, which is the AI factory case

Assumptions
- A fiber survey can be done before the optic order. (owner: Network operations, status: open)
- The change board will accept the pilot inside the current window. (owner: Internal IT PM, status: open)

Constraints
- [schedule] The 6 to 10 week window starts when hardware arrives, not when the program is chartered.
- [technical] A span is ordered as BiDi only after the survey shows the fiber.', 604, '[-0.217391,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043478,0.000000,0.086957,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043478,-0.521739,0.000000,0.000000,0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.086957,0.086957,-0.260870,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.130435,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.086957,0.000000,0.043478,-0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.086957,0.000000,-0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.086957,0.000000,0.000000,0.086957,0.000000,0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043478,0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043478,0.130435,-0.043478,0.043478,-0.043478,0.217391,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043478,-0.130435,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.130435,0.000000,0.000000,0.043478,0.000000,0.086957,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043478,-0.043478,0.000000,-0.173913,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.086957,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.086957,0.086957,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,-0.173913,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043478,0.000000,-0.043478,0.086957,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043478,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.086957,0.000000,0.086957,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000