aliases: Silicon One, data center, 400G, Hyperfabric, fabric, BiDi
fidelity: public_composite
Cost planning band
Amounts follow the pod and the optic scope. They are not the cost of replacing a data center in a few weeks.
- Switches and 400G optics for one pod (capex): 800000–5000000 USD. Planning band after the survey, not before.
- Dashboard and NOS (opex): 100000–600000 USD. Planning band.
- Survey and turn-up (opex): 80000–300000 USD. Internal operations time can replace part of this.

Decisions
- D1 What the few weeks cover: The pilot pod after hardware arrival. Six to ten weeks in the plan.. No public record in this bank supports a whole data center in that window.
- D2 Training work: Out of scope. Point to the AI factory case if a job is required.. This charter is the fabric.', 536, '[-0.141421,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.141421,0.000000,0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047140,0.000000,-0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047140,-0.424264,0.047140,0.000000,0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.235702,0.141421,-0.377124,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.141421,-0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.094281,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047140,0.094281,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.094281,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.141421,0.000000,-0.047140,0.188562,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.188562,0.094281,0.000000,0.000000,-0.141421,0.000000,0.000000,0.047140,0.000000,0.094281,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047140,0.000000,-0.094281,0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.094281,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.188562,0.094281,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047140,-0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.094281,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047140,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047140,-0.047140,0.04