Cost planning band
Amounts and durations are planning bands for an SOC pilot. They are not a quote and not a time-saved result.
- XDR pilot entitlement (opex): 200000–900000 USD. Planning band.
- Evaluation-set scoring (opex): 40000–150000 USD. Analyst time.
- SOAR adjustments (opex): 0–200000 USD. Zero if SOAR is out of scope or needs no change.

Decisions
- D1 Who approves containment: A named person. The assistant and Instant Attack Verification do not.. The public material describes assistance and a check.
