  '8be6569f-885a-40c8-a3a6-e89c4ddcd776', 'IND-SIE-COP-001', 'siemens-industrial-copilot', 'Siemens Industrial Copilot for automation engineering', 'Siemens Industrial Copilot for automation engineering',
  'public_announcement', 'primary_source', 'Summary of the Siemens and Microsoft release of 31 October 2023. The weeks-to-minutes statement and the Schaeffler adoption note are the companies'' published claims, not an independent audit. No customer downtime percentage is stated in that release.', 'published', 'public',
  'Siemens and Microsoft introduced Siemens Industrial Copilot, a generative assistant that drafts, optimizes, and debugs automation code from Siemens Xcelerator data plus Azure OpenAI Service. The release says a task that previously took weeks can be shortened to minutes, that customer data stays under customer control and is not used to train the underlying models, and that Schaeffler is an early adopter. This record is the PM shell for copying that pattern: a bounded engineering pilot, a human accept/reject step on generated code, and a separate decision before any plant downtime claim.', 'Automation engineers write and debug PLC and robot code by hand, and simulation cycles stretch across weeks. Maintenance staff need repair steps and simulation access without waiting on a specialist. A general chatbot does not see the plant''s automation project, and sending that project to a model trainer would break the customer''s data boundary.', 'The published copilot reads automation and simulation information from Siemens Xcelerator and uses Azure OpenAI Service. Natural language is the interface for code generation and for maintenance instructions. The same release says further copilots are planned for manufacturing, infrastructure, transportation, and healthcare, and that the Teamcenter app for Microsoft Teams was to become generally available in December 2023.', 'Put generative assistance on the engineering path first, where a wrong line of code can be reviewed before it reaches a robot. Operations use, including any downtime goal, stays a later decision.', 'Engineers spend review time instead of blank-page time on pilot cells. The release''s weeks-to-minutes claim is the vendor''s design claim. A plant should measure its own before-and-after on a frozen set of code tasks and should not reprint the vendor sentence as its result.',
  'manufacturing', 'Manufacturing', 'industrial', 'Discrete manufacturing', 'Global', array['IEC 62443', 'EU AI Act obligations for high-risk industrial uses', 'Customer data-processing terms'],
  'Plant or multi-plant manufacturer', 'hybrid', 'Siemens Xcelerator with Azure OpenAI Service', 'Automation and simulation context from Siemens Xcelerator, generation through Azure OpenAI Service, customer-controlled data that is not used to train the foundation models, and a human accept or reject step before generated code is committed.', 'high',
  'Amounts and durations below are planning bands for a similar program. They are not the publisher''s result and not a price quote.', 400000, 2000000, 'L',
  6, 12, 12, 24,
  array['Siemens Industrial Copilot', 'Siemens Xcelerator', 'Teamcenter'], array['Microsoft Azure OpenAI Service', 'Microsoft Teams'], array['Natural-language automation code', 'Code optimization and debug', 'Simulation assistance', 'Repair-instruction assistant'], array['Customer data not used for model training', 'Human acceptance of generated code', 'Separation of engineering and operations tenants'], array['Siemens Industrial Copilot', 'PLC', 'Schaeffler', 'Xcelerator', 'factory automation', 'generative code'],
  array['One automation cell and one robot or PLC family', 'A frozen set of code tasks with a human baseline', 'Accept or reject log on every generated block', 'A data-processing check that plant projects are not used to train the foundation model'], array['Unattended download of generated code to a production controller', 'A published downtime percentage for Schaeffler or any other plant', 'Copilots for healthcare or transportation in the same charter'], array['Every generated block in the pilot has an accept or reject record', 'The task-time baseline and the pilot measurement use the same frozen task list', 'The data-flow memo names what leaves the plant tenant'], 'published', array['Publisher claim, Siemens and Microsoft, 31 October 2023: the copilot generates, optimizes, and debugs complex automation code and shortens a task that previously took weeks to minutes.', 'Publisher claim, same release: customers keep control of their data, and that data is not used to train the underlying models.', 'Publisher fact, same release: Schaeffler is an early adopter and uses generative AI so engineers can generate code for industrial automation such as robots. The release says Schaeffler intends to use the copilot to reduce downtime. It does not publish a measured downtime result.'],
  null, null, '2023-10-31'
);
