fidelity: primary_source
Siemens and Microsoft introduced Siemens Industrial Copilot, a generative assistant that drafts, optimizes, and debugs automation code from Siemens Xcelerator data plus Azure OpenAI Service. The release says a task that previously took weeks can be shortened to minutes, that customer data stays under customer control and is not used to train the underlying models, and that Schaeffler is an early adopter. This record is the PM shell for copying that pattern: a bounded engineering pilot, a human accept/reject step on generated code, and a separate decision before any plant downtime claim.', 502, '[-0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052778,0.000000,0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052778,-0.211112,0.000000,0.000000,0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.105556,0.105556,-0.263890,0.158334,0.000000,0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052778,0.000000,-0.105556,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.105556,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052778,0.158334,-0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,-0.158334,0.052778,0.000000,0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.105556,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052778,-0.105556,0.000000,-0.316668,0.000000,-0.052778,0.000000,-0.052778,0.000000,0.000000,0.00