Problem: Automation engineers write and debug PLC and robot code by hand, and simulation cycles stretch across weeks. Maintenance staff need repair steps and simulation access without waiting on a specialist. A general chatbot does not see the plant''s automation project, and sending that project to a model trainer would break the customer''s data boundary.

Opportunity: The published copilot reads automation and simulation information from Siemens Xcelerator and uses Azure OpenAI Service. Natural language is the interface for code generation and for maintenance instructions. The same release says further copilots are planned for manufacturing, infrastructure, transportation, and healthcare, and that the Teamcenter app for Microsoft Teams was to become generally available in December 2023.', 604, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,-0.281594,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.140797,0.046932,-0.469323,0.046932,-0.046932,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.093865,0.000000,-0.093865,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,-0.093865,0.000000,-0.046932,0.046932,-0.093865,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,-0.046932,0.187729,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.140797,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,-0.234662,0.000000,-0.187729,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.187729,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,-0.046932,0.0