Strategic alignment: Put generative assistance on the engineering path first, where a wrong line of code can be reviewed before it reaches a robot. Operations use, including any downtime goal, stays a later decision.

Business value: Engineers spend review time instead of blank-page time on pilot cells. The release''s weeks-to-minutes claim is the vendor''s design claim. A plant should measure its own before-and-after on a frozen set of code tasks and should not reprint the vendor sentence as its result.', 459, '[-0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.131306,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.065653,0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.065653,-0.262613,0.000000,0.000000,0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.065653,0.196960,0.000000,0.131306,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.065653,0.065653,-0.131306,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,0.065653,0.000000,0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.196960,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.131306,-0.065653,0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,-0.065653,0.196960,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.196960,0.000000,-0.065653,0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.065653,0.000000,-0.262613,0.000000,-0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.131306,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,-0.065653,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000