On 31 October 2023 Siemens and Microsoft introduced Siemens Industrial Copilot. It is a generative assistant for human-machine collaboration in manufacturing. Users generate, optimize, and debug complex automation code. The companies say this shortens a task that previously took weeks to minutes. The copilot ingests automation and process-simulation information from Siemens Xcelerator and uses Azure OpenAI Service. Customers maintain control of their data, and that data is not used to train the underlying models.', 464, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.059028,0.000000,0.059028,0.000000,0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.059028,-0.177084,0.000000,0.000000,0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.118056,0.118056,-0.295141,0.177084,0.000000,0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.059028,0.000000,-0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.118056,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.059028,0.177084,0.000000,0.118056,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.059028,0.000000,-0.118056,0.000000,-0.295141,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.059028,0.000000,0.000000,0.0000