title: Siemens Industrial Copilot for automation engineering
industry: Manufacturing (manufacturing)
segment: Discrete manufacturing
solutions: Siemens Industrial Copilot, Siemens Xcelerator, Teamcenter
partners: Microsoft Azure OpenAI Service, Microsoft Teams
aliases: Siemens Industrial Copilot, PLC, Schaeffler, Xcelerator, factory automation, generative code
fidelity: primary_source
In scope
- One automation cell and one robot or PLC family
- A frozen set of code tasks with a human baseline
- Accept or reject log on every generated block
- A data-processing check that plant projects are not used to train the foundation model

Out of scope
- Unattended download of generated code to a production controller
- A published downtime percentage for Schaeffler or any other plant
- Copilots for healthcare or transportation in the same charter

Assumptions
- The plant can open a non-production engineering project in Xcelerator. (owner: Automation lead, status: open)
- Legal can confirm the Azure OpenAI data terms for this tenant. (owner: Legal, status: open)', 544, '[0.000000,0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055216,-0.220863,0.000000,0.000000,0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.110432,0.055216,-0.055216,0.055216,0.000000,0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055216,0.000000,-0.110432,0.000000,-0.110432,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055216,0.110432,0.000000,0.000000,-0.110432,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055216,-0.110432,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.110432,0.165647,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.110432,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.110432,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.165647,0.055216,0.000000,0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,-0.220863,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055216,-0.110432,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.220863,0.000000,-0.331295,0.000000,-0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.165647,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055216,-0.220863,0.000000,-0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.055216,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.165647,0.276079,0.000000,0.000000,-0.055216,0.055216,0.000000,0.165647,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.110432,0.000000,0.0000