1 Cell charter [Initiating/Scope] owner Customer PM, 5–8 days, deliverable: Charter. Name the cell, the controller family, and the frozen tasks.
2.1 Data memo [Planning/AI governance] owner Legal, 5–10 days, deliverable: Data memo. Map what the copilot can read and what is excluded from model training.
2.2 Tenant boundary [Planning/Security] owner OT security, 5–10 days, deliverable: Boundary sketch. Keep the engineering tenant off the production controller network.
2.3 Baseline the tasks [Planning/Schedule] owner Automation lead, 5–8 days, deliverable: Baseline sheet. Time the frozen tasks under the current manual method.
3.1 Guided generation [Executing/Quality] owner Automation lead, 15–25 days, deliverable: Accept log. Generate, optimize, and debug code for the frozen tasks.
3.2 Simulation compare [Executing/Quality] owner Automation lead, 10–15 days, deliverable: Timing sheet. Compare simulation effort on the same tasks. Do not copy the vendor''s weeks-to-minutes sentence into the result.
4 Sponsor readout [Monitoring and controlling/Communications] owner Customer PM, 3–5 days, deliverable: Readout. Show the accept rate and the plant''s own times beside the vendor claim.
5 Download decision [Closing/Risk] owner Operations sponsor, 3–5 days, deliverable: Decision. Decide whether any accepted block may move toward a production controller.', 886, '[0.000000,0.066299,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.265197,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033150,0.000000,-0.066299,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,-0.530395,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,-0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.099449,0.132599,-0.232048,0.033150,0.000000,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033150,0.066299,-0.066299,0.000000,0.000000,0.066299,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033150,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,-0.033150,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.265197,0.000000,-0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.099449,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033150,0.099449,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033150,0.033150,0.000000,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.066299,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,-0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.066299,0.000000,-0.066299,0.000000,-0.132599,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.066299,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.066299,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.066299,0.000000,0.066299,-0.165748,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.099449,0.000000,0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.033150,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.066299,0.165748,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0