Outcomes
- Publisher claim, Siemens and Microsoft, 31 October 2023: the copilot generates, optimizes, and debugs complex automation code and shortens a task that previously took weeks to minutes.
- Publisher claim, same release: customers keep control of their data, and that data is not used to train the underlying models.
- Publisher fact, same release: Schaeffler is an early adopter and uses generative AI so engineers can generate code for industrial automation such as robots. The release says Schaeffler intends to use the copilot to reduce downtime. It does not publish a measured downtime result.', 508, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,-0.053916,0.053916,0.000000,0.053916,0.000000,0.107833,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.053916,-0.269582,0.000000,0.000000,0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.215666,0.107833,-0.269582,0.107833,0.000000,0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.053916,0.000000,-0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.107833,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.053916,0.000000,-0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.053916,0.161749,-0.053916,0.107833,0.000000,0.000000,-0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.107833,0.000000,0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,-0.161749,0.000000,0.000000,0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.107833,0.000000,-0.269582,0.000000,-0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.215666,0.000000,-0.107833,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.053916,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.0000