Cost planning band
Amounts and durations below are planning bands for a similar program. They are not the publisher''s result and not a price quote.
- Copilot and Xcelerator pilot entitlements (opex): 150000–700000 USD. Planning band. Confirm the SKU.
- Azure OpenAI consumption (opex): 20000–150000 USD. Planning band for a single cell.
- Engineering support for the first cell (opex): 80000–250000 USD. Internal automation staff can replace part of this.

Decisions
- D1 Production download: Not allowed during the pilot.. The release demonstrates engineering assistance, not an unattended controller change.
