In scope
- One sprayer platform and the crops the installed software supports
- A season plan that records acres, mix, and the broadcast comparison
- Operator training on when targeted mode is exited
- A readout that cites Deere''s 2024 figures separately from this farm''s maps

Out of scope
- Treating 59 percent as this farm''s target before a season of maps
- Using the system on a crop the installed release does not support
- Ignoring the release footnotes on weed pressure, speed, and settings

Assumptions
- The sprayer can send application data to Operations Center. (owner: Equipment lead, status: open)
- The agronomist will read the as-applied map after each block of fields. (owner: Agronomist, status: open)', 532, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052852,-0.052852,0.000000,-0.052852,0.000000,-0.105703,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052852,-0.475665,0.000000,0.000000,0.052852,0.000000,0.105703,-0.211407,0.000000,-0.052852,0.052852,-0.264258,0.000000,-0.105703,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.105703,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.105703,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.158555,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.158555,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.105703,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.105703,0.000000,-0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.105703,-0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052852,-0.105703,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.105703,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.105703,0.000000,0.000000,0.052852,0.000000,0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052852,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.052852,0.000000,-0.211407,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.105703,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.052852,0