1 Season charter [Initiating/Scope] owner Operations PM, 5–10 days, deliverable: Season plan. Name the machine, crops, and blocks. Copy Deere''s crop list and do not add others.
2.1 Machine setup [Planning/Resource] owner Equipment lead, 5–15 days, deliverable: Ready check. Confirm cameras, nozzles, and software for that model year.
2.2 Operator card [Planning/Quality] owner Operator lead, 3–5 days, deliverable: Operator card. When to stay in targeted mode and when weed pressure means a switch.
2.3 Claim card [Planning/Communications] owner Operations PM, 1–2 days, deliverable: Claim card. Write Deere''s 59 percent, 8 million gallons, and 1 million acres as Deere''s 2024 figures.
3.1 Apply [Executing/Schedule] owner Operator lead, 20–40 days, deliverable: Application log. Run the season blocks and keep the machine data.
3.2 Maps [Executing/Quality] owner Agronomist, 5–10 days, deliverable: Map pack. Open the broadcast comparison after each block.
4 Mid-season readout [Monitoring and controlling/Communications] owner Operations PM, 2–4 days, deliverable: Readout. Show this farm''s maps beside the claim card. Do not average them into 59.
5 Season file [Closing/Integration] owner Records owner, 5–8 days, deliverable: Season file. Store acres, mix, maps, and exceptions for the pesticide record.', 826, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.281788,0.000000,0.000000,0.070447,0.000000,0.000000,-0.035223,0.000000,-0.035223,0.000000,-0.070447,0.000000,0.000000,0.070447,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.035223,-0.211341,0.000000,0.000000,0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,-0.140894,0.000000,-0.140894,0.000000,-0.422682,0.000000,-0.070447,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.035223,0.140894,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.070447,0.000000,0.000000,-0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.035223,-0.070447,0.070447,0.000000,0.000000,-0.035223,0.035223,-0.035223,0.035223,-0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.317011,0.000000,-0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.105670,0.000000,-0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.070447,0.000000,0.070447,0.000000,0.140894,0.000000,0.000000,-0.105670,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.070447,-0.035223,0.035223,0.000000,0.105670,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.035223,0.035223,0.000000,0.035223,-0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.035223,0.000000,0.070447,0.000000,0.000000,-0.035223,0.035223,0.000000,0.035223,0.000000,0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,-0.070447,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.035223,0.000000,-0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.035223,-0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,-0.035223,0.000000,-0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.140894,0.000000,0.000000,0.035223,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-