Outcomes
- Publisher claim, John Deere, 18 September 2024: an estimated 8 million gallons of herbicide mix saved on more than 1 million acres in the 2024 season.
- Publisher claim, same release: average herbicide savings of 59 percent on corn, soybean, and cotton fields across the United States. The release says individual results vary.
- Publisher description, same release: cameras scan over 2,100 square feet per second at up to 15 mph, and ExactApply nozzles spray only where a weed is recognized.
