KPIs
- Mapped acres: baseline None → target Every targeted-mode acre has a map acres. Reconcile the machine log to Operations Center
- Farm savings versus broadcast: baseline Not measured → target Computed from this farm''s maps percent. Do not enter 59 unless the map says 59
- Mode exceptions: baseline None → target Each exit from targeted mode has a reason count. Operator card

Cost planning band
Amounts and durations below are planning bands for a similar program. They are not the publisher''s result and not a price quote.
- See & Spray equipped sprayer or retrofit (capex): 100000–700000 USD. Planning band. Deere prices by model and Deere says customers pay for acres used.
- Acre entitlement and Operations Center (opex): 10000–80000 USD. Planning band for one season.
