Opportunity: AWS describes Drug Design Studio on AWS: scientists pick proteins, algorithms propose mRNA sequences, jobs run through a queue and EC2, and an automated plant can make up to 1,000 constructs a month. The 5 August 2020 AWS release says Moderna selected AWS as its preferred cloud and standard for analytics and machine learning, and that the first clinical batch of mRNA-1273 went to NIH for Phase 1 42 days after sequencing. The case-study page states the 2-day sequence and 25-day batch. A 2017 AWS case quotes Marcello Damiani that a Zika vaccine candidate reached clinical trials in a year, against years in a traditional path.

Strategic alignment: The platform is the asset. A pandemic timeline is a published example with a source note, not a service level for the next program.', 597, '[-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,-0.429537,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.085907,0.000000,-0.429537,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,0.000000,0.214768,-0.085907,0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,-0.343629,0.000000,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,-0.085907,0.042954,-0.042954,0.171815,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,-0.042954,0.042954,-0.128861,0.000000,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,-0.042954,0.000000,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.128861,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.128861,0.085907,-0.042954,0.000000,-0.085907,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042954,0.171815,0.000000,0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.128861,0.042954,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.085907,0.000000,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.128861,0.000000,0.000000,0.128861,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,-0.042954,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.042954,0.0000