On 5 August 2020 AWS said Moderna had selected AWS as its preferred cloud and its standard for analytics and machine learning, and that the first clinical batch of mRNA-1273 was delivered to NIH for Phase 1 42 days after the virus was sequenced. An AWS case-study page says the sequence was completed in 2 days using machine learning on AWS and the first clinical batch was released 25 days later. Both statements stay in this record with their sources.

The same case-study page says cryo-EM can generate tens of terabytes a day and that Moderna used a data cloud on AWS to land, check, and harmonize instrument data. That is the integration requirement in this charter. It is not a license to quote a single pandemic interval as the next program''s goal.', 576, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.125327,0.000000,0.000000,0.125327,0.000000,0.041776,0.000000,0.000000,-0.125327,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041776,-0.417756,0.000000,0.000000,0.041776,-0.041776,0.000000,-0.041776,0.000000,-0.125327,0.041776,-0.375980,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.250654,-0.041776,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.334205,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041776,-0.041776,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.083551,0.083551,0.000000,0.125327,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041776,0.041776,-0.083551,0.041776,-0.041776,0.041776,0.000000,0.000000,-0.125327,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.083551,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041776,0.125327,-0.041776,0.041776,-0.083551,0.041776,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041776,0.000000,0.000000,0.041776,-0.041776,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041776,-0.125327,0.041776,0.000000,0.083551,-0.041776,0.125327,0.000000,0.083551,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.041776,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.083551,0.041776,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.125327,0.000000,-0.083551,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.041776,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.125327,0.000000,0.000000,0.083551,-0.041776,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000