fidelity: primary_source
In scope
- One new sequence program from design ticket to preclinical batch
- A citation sheet for the 2-day, 25-day, and 42-day statements
- Human quality release before a batch is called clinical
- A data path for instrument files into a single store

Out of scope
- Promising either 25 or 42 days for a future pathogen
- Using the COVID-19 timeline as a manufacturing SLA
- Skipping QA release because the studio job finished

Assumptions
- Research and GMP-adjacent systems can be separated. (owner: Quality, status: open)
- The citation sheet is mandatory in any external timeline slide. (owner: Program PM, status: open)

Constraints
- [regulatory] A batch is not clinical until Quality releases it. A finished compute job is not a release.
- [communications] External timelines quote the AWS page and the date. They do not blend 25 and 42 into one figure.', 630, '[-0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.132068,0.044023,0.000000,0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,-0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.044023,-0.352180,0.000000,0.000000,0.044023,-0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.044023,0.044023,-0.440225,0.000000,-0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,0.088045,-0.044023,0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,-0.176090,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.044023,0.000000,0.044023,-0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,0.132068,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.088045,0.088045,-0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.044023,0.000000,-0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.044023,0.176090,0.000000,0.000000,-0.088045,0.044023,0.000000,0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,-0.044023,0.088045,-0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,-0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.220113,-0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,0.044023,0.000000,0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.176090,0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.044023,0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,-0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.176090,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.044023,0.000000,-0.044023,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.044023,0.000000,-0.088045,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.088045,0.000000,0.044023,0.000000,