1 Citation sheet [Initiating/Communications] owner Program PM, 2–4 days, deliverable: Citation sheet. Paste both AWS timeline sentences with URLs. Do not edit them into one number.
2.1 One program [Planning/Scope] owner Computational scientist, 5–8 days, deliverable: Design ticket. Name the protein target and the success evidence for this pilot.
2.2 Accounts [Planning/Security] owner Data platform lead, 8–12 days, deliverable: Account map. Separate research compute from the manufacturing record.
2.3 Instrument path [Planning/Integration] owner Data platform lead, 10–15 days, deliverable: Ingestion test. Land the pilot''s instrument files in one store.
3.1 Design jobs [Executing/Quality] owner Computational scientist, 10–20 days, deliverable: Job log. Run studio jobs for the named target and keep the job log.
3.2 Physical construct [Executing/Resource] owner Preclinical manufacturing lead, 10–20 days, deliverable: Batch record. Make the preclinical batch only after the design ticket is accepted.
3.3 Quality release [Executing/Quality] owner Quality, 3–8 days, deliverable: Release. A person releases or holds the batch.
