fidelity: primary_source
Outcomes
- AWS press release, 5 August 2020: Moderna delivered the first clinical batch of mRNA-1273 to NIH for the Phase 1 trial 42 days after the initial sequencing of the virus.
- AWS case-study page: Moderna completed the mRNA COVID-19 vaccine sequence in 2 days using machine learning on AWS, and the first clinical batch was released 25 days later.
- AWS 2017 case study: the automated preclinical plant can create as many as 1,000 mRNA constructs a month, and Damiani said a Zika candidate reached clinical trials in a year.

KPIs
- Citation completeness: baseline Mixed oral timelines → target Every external day count has a URL count. Review of the deck
- Release discipline: baseline Unset → target Zero batches called clinical without a quality signature count. Batch record
- Ticket to batch trace: baseline Unset → target The pilot batch cites its design ticket count. Batch record', 646, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.161296,0.000000,0.000000,0.080648,0.000000,0.080648,0.000000,0.000000,-0.080648,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.040324,-0.443563,0.000000,0.000000,0.040324,-0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.080648,0.000000,-0.241943,0.000000,-0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.201619,-0.040324,0.000000,-0.040324,0.000000,-0.322591,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.040324,-0.161296,0.080648,0.000000,0.201619,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.040324,-0.120972,0.040324,-0.080648,0.000000,-0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.080648,-0.040324,0.040324,0.000000,0.080648,-0.080648,0.080648,0.000000,0.000000,-0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.040324,-0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.120972,0.000000,0.080648,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.040324,0.040324,-0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.120972,0.000000,-0.040324,0.000000,-0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.080648,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.120972,0.000000,-0.161296,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.040324,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.080648,-0.080648,0.000000,