Cost planning band
Amounts and durations below are planning bands for a similar program. They are not the publisher''s result and not a price quote.
- Cloud compute and storage for one program (opex): 200000–1500000 USD. Planning band. Not Moderna''s AWS spend.
- Data platform work for instrument landing (opex): 150000–800000 USD. Planning band.
- QA release support (opex): 50000–200000 USD. Internal quality time.

Decisions
- D1 Timeline language: Quote the 5 August 2020 press release and the case-study page separately.. They do not state the same interval.
- D2 What finished means: Quality release, not job success.. The studio finishing is an upstream event.', 532, '[-0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.143182,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047727,-0.334092,0.000000,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047727,-0.238637,0.047727,-0.429547,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.190910,-0.095455,0.000000,-0.047727,0.000000,-0.190910,0.000000,-0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.143182,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.095455,0.047727,-0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.095455,-0.047727,0.000000,-0.047727,0.000000,-0.047727,0.095455,-0.143182,0.000000,-0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,-0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.143182,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.143182,0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.095455,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.095455,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.143182,-0.047727,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.047727,0.000000,0.095455,-0.047727