) values (
  '23d52212-509e-4aaa-ad4f-ab2ee1a16b80', 'IND-DBS-AI-001', 'dbs-bank-industrialized-ai', 'DBS industrialized AI and the published value claim', 'DBS industrialized AI and the published value claim',
  'public_announcement', 'primary_source', 'Model counts and the SGD 1 billion figure are DBS''s own statements, and they moved between the 16 September 2024 newsroom quote and a later DBS page. This record stores both dates. It is not an independent valuation.', 'published', 'public',
  'DBS has industrialized machine learning across the bank and published the scale. On 16 September 2024 the DBS newsroom quoted CEO Piyush Gupta: more than 800 AI models across 350 use cases, with measured economic impact expected to exceed SGD 1 billion in 2025. A later DBS page, current as of May 2025, says more than 1,500 models across 370 use cases and the same 2025 value figure. Harvard Business School published a case on the journey, including the bank''s PURE ethical framework. The PM pattern is a use-case portfolio with an owner, a value method, and a human in the loop, not a single model.', 'A bank can accumulate models that nobody owns, with a value story that is a slide rather than a method. Generative use cases then arrive on top of unclear data rights. Staff and customers cannot tell which decisions are assisted and which are automatic.', 'DBS''s published approach is a portfolio: hundreds of models, hundreds of use cases, and a stated economic impact. The September 2024 newsroom also says DBS ranked first for AI strategy leadership in the 2023 Global Evident AI Index and tenth overall, the only Asian bank in that top ten. The HBS case describes the PURE framework for ethical use: purposeful, unsurprising, respectful, and explainable. A May 2025 DBS article says the bank keeps a human in the loop and treats generative AI as a copilot.', 'Industrializing AI means a registry, a value method, and a governance forum. A new generative pilot joins that registry. It does not start a second one.', 'The sponsor can see which use cases have an owner and a measurement, and can retire the rest. The SGD 1 billion figure remains DBS''s published expectation, cited with the date of the page that stated it.',
  'financial_services', 'Financial services', 'retail_bank', 'Retail and corporate bank', 'APAC', array['MAS FEAT and AI risk expectations', 'PDPA', 'Model risk management'],
  'Bank', 'hybrid', 'Hybrid, with a central model registry', 'A registry of models and use cases, a value-capture method, a governance forum using the PURE tests, and a human accountable for customer-facing or risk decisions. Generative tools sit inside that registry as copilots.', 'high',
  'Amounts and durations below are planning bands for a similar program. They are not the publisher''s result and not a price quote.', 500000, 3000000, 'L',
  4, 10, 16, 32,
  array['Model and use-case registry', 'PURE governance', 'Generative copilot pattern'], array[]::text[], array['Hundreds of supervised models', 'Personalized customer nudges', 'Generative copilot for staff'], array['Human in the loop on customer and risk decisions', 'Purpose limitation', 'Explainability review'], array['DBS', 'PURE', 'model registry', 'Evident AI Index', 'Singapore bank', 'responsible AI'],
  array['A registry with owner, purpose, and value method for every in-scope model', 'A PURE review on new use cases', 'One generative copilot with a named human decision', 'A citation note when DBS''s published counts are used externally'], array['Adopting SGD 1 billion as this bank''s target', 'Unattended credit or complaint decisions', 'A second AI governance forum beside the existing one'], array['Every in-scope production model has an owner and a purpose', 'Value is either measured with the agreed method or marked unmeasured', 'The generative pilot names the human who accepts the output'], 'published', array['DBS newsroom, 16 September 2024, quoting Piyush Gupta: more than 800 AI models across 350 use cases, with measured economic impact expected to exceed SGD 1 billion in 2025.', 'Same newsroom: DBS ranked first for AI strategy leadership in the 2023 Global Evident AI Index, tenth overall, and was the only Asian bank in that top ten.', 'DBS page current as of May 2025: more than 1,500 models across 370 use cases, still tied to SGD 1 billion of economic value by 2025, and a human-in-the-loop copilot stance.', 'Harvard Business School case: DBS developed the PURE framework, purposeful, unsurprising, respectful, and explainable.'],
  null, null, '2024-09-16'
);
