DBS has industrialized machine learning across the bank and published the scale. On 16 September 2024 the DBS newsroom quoted CEO Piyush Gupta: more than 800 AI models across 350 use cases, with measured economic impact expected to exceed SGD 1 billion in 2025. A later DBS page, current as of May 2025, says more than 1,500 models across 370 use cases and the same 2025 value figure. Harvard Business School published a case on the journey, including the bank''s PURE ethical framework. The PM pattern is a use-case portfolio with an owner, a value method, and a human in the loop, not a single model.

Problem: A bank can accumulate models that nobody owns, with a value story that is a slide rather than a method. Generative use cases then arrive on top of unclear data rights. Staff and customers cannot tell which decisions are assisted and which are automatic.', 618, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043811,0.000000,-0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.131432,-0.043811,0.043811,-0.131432,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.087622,0.000000,0.000000,-0.131432,0.043811,-0.394297,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.043811,-0.043811,0.000000,-0.175243,0.043811,-0.350486,0.087622,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,-0.087622,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.043811,-0.131432,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,-0.131432,0.000000,-0.043811,0.000000,-0.043811,0.000000,-0.087622,0.000000,-0.087622,0.175243,0.000000,0.043811,-0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043811,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,-0.219054,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,-0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.131432,0.175243,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043811,0.000000,-0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.087622,-0.043811,0.000000,-0.087622,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,-0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.043811,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000