On 16 September 2024 DBS said Harvard Business School had published a case on the bank''s AI strategy, the first HBS AI case on an Asian bank. The newsroom quotes CEO Piyush Gupta: the bank deploys more than 800 AI models across 350 use cases and expects the measured economic impact to exceed SGD 1 billion in 2025. The same note says DBS ranked first for AI strategy leadership in the 2023 Global Evident AI Index, tenth overall, and was the only Asian bank in that top ten.', 423, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049568,-0.099136,0.000000,-0.198273,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049568,0.049568,-0.446113,0.000000,0.000000,0.049568,0.000000,0.049568,-0.049568,0.000000,-0.198273,0.000000,-0.297409,0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.099136,-0.099136,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.099136,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.148704,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.099136,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,0.099136,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.099136,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,-0.049568,0.000000,-0.049568,0.000000,-0.247841,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.049568,-0.049568,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.198273,0.396545,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000