The HBS case, as described by Harvard Business Impact, covers the industrialization of AI since 2014 and the PURE framework: purposeful, unsurprising, respectful, and explainable use of customer data. A DBS article current as of May 2025 updates the scale to more than 1,500 models across 370 use cases, still associated with SGD 1 billion of economic value by 2025, and says the bank uses a copilot pattern with a human in the loop for risk and customer interaction.

Those sentences are DBS''s account of DBS. A different bank can copy the registry, the value method, and the forum. It cannot copy the billion.', 491, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.046932,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.093865,-0.046932,0.093865,-0.140797,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.093865,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,-0.093865,0.046932,-0.516256,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.046932,-0.093865,0.000000,-0.093865,0.000000,-0.375459,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.093865,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.093865,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.187729,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.093865,0.000000,0.000000,0.140797,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.093865,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.234662,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.187729,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.093865,-0.093865,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.046932,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.093865,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.00