1 Registry charter [Initiating/Integration] owner AI program PM, 5–8 days, deliverable: Charter. Fix the fields. Cite DBS counts only with a date.
2.1 Value method [Planning/Cost] owner Finance partner, 8–12 days, deliverable: Method note. Finance writes what counts as value and what stays unmeasured.
2.2 PURE checklist [Planning/AI governance] owner Conduct and privacy, 5–8 days, deliverable: Checklist. Translate purposeful, unsurprising, respectful, and explainable into review questions.
3.1 Inventory [Executing/Scope] owner Model risk, 15–25 days, deliverable: Registry. Load production models. A missing owner becomes an issue, not a blank.
3.2 One copilot [Executing/AI governance] owner Conduct and privacy, 10–15 days, deliverable: Review minute. Put one generative assistant through PURE and name the human decision.
3.3 Value pass [Executing/Cost] owner Finance partner, 10–15 days, deliverable: Value column. Apply the method or mark unmeasured.
4 Retire or assign [Monitoring and controlling/Risk] owner Model risk, 5–10 days, deliverable: Exception log. Models with no owner are turned off or assigned.
5 Citation note [Closing/Communications] owner AI program PM, 2–4 days, deliverable: Citation note. If a deck quotes DBS, it quotes the 16 September 2024 numbers and the later May 2025 numbers as two dates.', 849, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.034401,0.000000,-0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.275208,0.034401,-0.034401,0.103203,-0.103203,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.034401,0.034401,-0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.034401,-0.206406,0.000000,0.000000,0.034401,-0.034401,0.034401,-0.034401,0.000000,-0.068802,0.000000,-0.344010,0.103203,-0.034401,0.103203,0.000000,0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.103203,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.068802,0.068802,0.000000,0.000000,-0.068802,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.068802,-0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.068802,-0.034401,0.000000,-0.034401,0.068802,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.344010,0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.172005,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.034401,0.068802,0.000000,0.137604,-0.034401,0.000000,-0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.068802,-0.137604,0.034401,0.000000,0.034401,0.000000,0.103203,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,-0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.103203,0.068802,0.000000,0.034401,0.000000,0.034401,0.000000,0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.137604,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.034401,0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.034401,0.240807,-0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.068802,0.068802,0.000000,0.000000,-0.068802,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.034401,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.034401,0.000000,0.068802,-0.034401,0.000000,0.