R1 SGD 1 billion is copied onto this bank [communications] P4 I4 avoid. Mitigation: External text names DBS, the date, and the page. Trigger: A draft says we will deliver 1 billion Owner: AI program PM
R2 The model count is frozen [communications] P3 I2 mitigate. Mitigation: Quote both dates or quote only the page you opened. Trigger: A slide has a count and no date Owner: AI program PM
R3 Orphan models stay in production [risk] P3 I4 mitigate. Mitigation: No owner means an issue and a retirement clock. Trigger: A production model has a blank owner after the inventory gate Owner: Model risk
