Outcomes
- DBS newsroom, 16 September 2024, quoting Piyush Gupta: more than 800 AI models across 350 use cases, with measured economic impact expected to exceed SGD 1 billion in 2025.
- Same newsroom: DBS ranked first for AI strategy leadership in the 2023 Global Evident AI Index, tenth overall, and was the only Asian bank in that top ten.
- DBS page current as of May 2025: more than 1,500 models across 370 use cases, still tied to SGD 1 billion of economic value by 2025, and a human-in-the-loop copilot stance.
- Harvard Business School case: DBS developed the PURE framework, purposeful, unsurprising, respectful, and explainable.', 504, '[0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.050702,0.000000,-0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.152106,-0.101404,0.050702,-0.152106,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,-0.101404,0.050702,-0.202808,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,0.000000,0.050702,-0.050702,0.000000,-0.253510,0.000000,-0.354914,0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,-0.101404,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.050702,0.050702,-0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,-0.152106,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.152106,0.000000,0.000000,0.152106,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,-0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,-0.101404,0.000000,-0.050702,0.000000,-0.354914,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,-0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.202808,0.304212,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,-0.050702,0.101404,0.000000,0.000000,-0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,-0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.101404,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,0.050702,0.000000,0.000000,0.000000,